    {
      "title": "Move the job",
      "requirements": "Canal is out of bench space. The staff can send a bike to Station, but the parts bins stay where they are. Before moving an approved repair, check that Station can do the entire job with its own unreserved stock.\n\nmove(ticket, shop) accepts a ticket in \"estimate\" or \"approved\" status and a known destination shop. Return False for an unknown ticket, a completed or canceled ticket, or an unknown shop.\n\n- If the destination is the current shop, return True and change nothing.\n- For an estimate, change the shop and return True. There are no reservations to move.\n- For an approved ticket, check the available quantity of every quoted part at the destination. If anything is short, return False. Leave the ticket and all reservations where they were. Otherwise, release the whole reservation at the original shop, reserve the same quantities at the destination, change the ticket's shop, and return True.\n\nA successful move keeps the status, labor price, parts, and quoted prices. It never changes physical stock. Completion and cancellation take effect at the ticket's current shop.",
